2026-02-28T18:54:46.497Z [info] [sequentialthinking] Message from client: {"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"sequentialthinking","arguments":{"thought":"Reconstruct real sequence timeline:\n\nDone:\n1. 16.09 (KW38) - Kennenlernen ✅\n2. 30.09 (KW40) - Passen/Fangen Einführung ✅  \n3. 14.10 (KW42) - Passen/Fangen Vertiefung ✅\n4. 28.10 (KW44) - Zielgenaues Werfen + Goalchaball ✅\n5. 03.12 (KW49) - BUV Schlagwurf \"Jahrmarkt\" ✅ (Note: Station 3 had first Sprungwurf contact)\n6. 14.01 (KW3) - LNW Drehwurf + Spielnote Goalchaball ✅\n\nGap between KW44 and KW49 = 5 weeks (KW45-48 no handball = pool weeks + holidays)\nGap KW49 to 14.01 = ~6 weeks (Weihnachtsferien)\n\nRemaining biweekly from 14.01:\n- 28.01 (KW5) - next gym session\n- 11.02 (KW7) - next gym session  \n- 25.02 (KW9) - next gym session\n- 02.03 (KW10) - LP (Monday, likely special date, only 5 days after 25.02)\n\nDecision: Include 25.02 or not?\n- If 25.02 is a regular Wednesday session and 02.03 is Monday LP = both happen, but only 5 days apart\n- For sequence integrity: include 25.02 as LP-Vorbereitung since it's very close to LP\n- Actually: user said \"einzelne UE kürzen\" - so I should cut. Drop 25.02, go directly 11.02 → LP 02.03 (3 weeks gap, acceptable)\n\nFinal sequence: 8 UE + LP = 9 entries total\nCut from original: Gruppentaktik (KW51), Abwehrverhalten (KW2), one Spielformen UE\nAdded vs original: LNW Drehwurf (real), shifted BUV content\n\nProgression logic still holds:\nPhase 1 (KW38-44): Grundtechniken (Passen, Fangen, Werfen) → Goalchaball\nPhase 2 (KW49-KW3): Wurftechniken (Schlagwurf BUV, Drehwurf LNW)  \nPhase 3 (KW5-7): Sprungwurf (Einführung → Vertiefung)\nPhase 4 (KW10): LP - Sprungwurf spielnah","thoughtNumber":1,"totalThoughts":1,"nextThoughtNeeded":false}},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2}
